pageType: content
background: { type: solid, color: "$bg" }
elements:
  - elementId: header-marker
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [36, 24, 8, 30]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }
  - elementId: header-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [54, 22, 680, 34]
    content: { style: "$pageTitle", wrap: false, text: "04. 验证与讨论 —— 解释与边界" }
  - elementId: header-brand
    elementType: text
    bounds: [730, 30, 194, 14]
    content: { style: "$label", fontSize: 9, align: [right, top], wrap: false, text: EV RANGE · RESEARCH }
  - elementId: header-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [36, 66, 888, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primaryDeep" }
  - elementId: statement
    elementType: text
    bounds: [52, 78, 856, 42]
    content:
      style: "$statement"
      align: [center, middle]
      text: |-
        <p>提升来自逐样本的驾驶强度，<span style="color:$danger">而不是更复杂的网络</span></p>
  - elementId: interp-frame
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [36, 132, 420, 138]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line" }
  - elementId: interp-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [54, 144, 384, 20]
    content: { style: "$heading", align: [center, top], wrap: false, text: 解释 / INTERPRETATION }
  - elementId: interp-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [54, 170, 384, 88]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 11.5
      text: |-
        <p>Q 把“同一 SOC、同一温度下为何能耗不同”编码为连续变量；权重排序与能耗机理一致。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:5px"><strong>证据：</strong>表 7 误差最低，表 8 的 R² 全部提升，增益应归因于特征。</p>
  - elementId: rival-frame
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [36, 282, 420, 152]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primarySoft" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$primaryTint" }
  - elementId: rival-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [54, 294, 384, 20]
    content: { style: "$heading", align: [center, top], wrap: false, text: 替代解释与排除 }
  - elementId: rival-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [54, 320, 384, 104]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 10.5
      lineHeight: 1.4
      text: |-
        <p><strong>网络容量</strong>：同输入下 LSTM 仍误差最低。</p>
        <p><strong>数据划分</strong>：7:3 / 8:2 / 9:1，不随机抽样。</p>
        <p><strong>仪表对照</strong>：原车仪表仅按 SOC 近似线性映射。</p>
        <p><strong>实现一致性</strong>：四种算法共享输入与划分。</p>
        <p><strong>基线完整性</strong>：同时对比仪表与不含 Q 模型。</p>
  - elementId: limit-frame
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [480, 132, 444, 302]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line" }
  - elementId: limit-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [498, 144, 408, 20]
    content: { style: "$heading", align: [center, top], wrap: false, text: 局限与偏差方向 / LIMITATIONS }
  - elementId: limit-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [498, 172, 408, 38]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 11
      text: |-
        <p><strong>单车型</strong>　仅 NEDC 310 km 一款车</p>
        <p style="color:$muted">→ 其他车型的泛化方向未知</p>
  - elementId: limit-sep-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [498, 214, 408, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }
  - elementId: limit-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [498, 220, 408, 38]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 11
      text: |-
        <p><strong>地域</strong>　车辆均在南方运行</p>
        <p style="color:$muted">→ 高寒、高原、高温场景未覆盖</p>
  - elementId: limit-sep-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [498, 262, 408, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }
  - elementId: limit-3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [498, 268, 408, 38]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 11
      text: |-
        <p><strong>数据</strong>　离线历史报文</p>
        <p style="color:$muted">→ 在线实时预测的延迟未评估</p>
  - elementId: limit-sep-3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [498, 310, 408, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }
  - elementId: limit-4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [498, 316, 408, 38]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 11
      text: |-
        <p><strong>证据</strong>　每车仅一个驾驶事件</p>
        <p style="color:$muted">→ 统计功效有限，R² 可能偏乐观</p>
  - elementId: limit-sep-4
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [498, 358, 408, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }
  - elementId: limit-5
    elementType: text
    bounds: [498, 364, 408, 38]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 11
      text: |-
        <p><strong>样本</strong>　4 辆车非随机抽取</p>
        <p style="color:$muted">→ 代表性有限，组均值可能偏移</p>
  - elementId: limit-next
    elementType: text
    bounds: [498, 408, 408, 20]
    content: { style: "$caption", fontSize: 9, wrap: false, text: 下一步：扩展地区与车型，并开展在线实时验证。 }
  - elementId: takeaway-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [36, 452, 888, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }
  - elementId: wave-left
    elementType: line
    bounds: [50, 464, 48, 14]
    viewBox: [48, 14]
    points: "0,7 8,7 12,2 17,12 23,5 28,7 48,7"
    curve: sharp
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$accent4" }
  - elementId: wave-right
    elementType: line
    bounds: [862, 464, 48, 14]
    viewBox: [48, 14]
    points: "0,7 20,7 25,5 31,12 36,2 40,7 48,7"
    curve: sharp
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$accent4" }
  - elementId: takeaway
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 456, 760, 30]
    content: { style: "$takeaway", align: [center, middle], wrap: false, text: 方向性结论有证据支持，但外推仍受车型、地域、数据与样本设计限制 }
  - elementId: footer-source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [36, 510, 680, 12]
    content: { style: "$nav", fontSize: 8.2, wrap: false, text: 解释依据：原文表 7、表 8；局限为作者研究边界 }
  - elementId: footer-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [836, 510, 88, 12]
    content: { style: "$nav", color: "$primary", bold: true, align: [right, top], wrap: false, text: 12 / 15 }
